{"text":"As a reference, over the past 50 years in the United States, which is very prone to talking about social mobility, they've seen a decline, about 50% decline in social mobility. So this is the probability of being born in one income class and ending your life in a higher income class has gone down by about 50%. We could spend a lot of time talking about the potential remedies, but I will say, remedies to inequality, I will say that one of the frustrations for academic economists, I would argue, is that we have seen over the last several decades, efforts on both left-leaning policies as well as right-leaning policies. By that I mean tax and redistribution policies as well as supply-side interventions, and the reality is neither of these have really worked to reduce the speed of inequality, the widening of inequality that we've seen.","words":[{"text":"As","start":0.48,"end":0.78},{"text":"a","start":0.78,"end":0.94},{"text":"reference","start":0.94,"end":1.62,"punct":","},{"text":"over","start":2.34,"end":2.52},{"text":"the","start":2.52,"end":2.7},{"text":"past","start":2.7,"end":2.96},{"text":"50","start":2.96,"end":3.42},{"text":"years","start":3.42,"end":3.72},{"text":"in","start":3.72,"end":4.06},{"text":"the","start":4.06,"end":4.16},{"text":"United","start":4.16,"end":4.4},{"text":"States","start":4.4,"end":4.92,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":5.4,"end":5.5},{"text":"is","start":5.5,"end":5.8},{"text":"very","start":5.8,"end":6.34},{"text":"prone","start":6.34,"end":6.82},{"text":"to","start":6.82,"end":7.38},{"text":"talking","start":7.38,"end":7.7},{"text":"about","start":7.7,"end":8.14},{"text":"social","start":8.14,"end":8.66},{"text":"mobility","start":8.66,"end":9.2,"punct":","},{"text":"they've","start":9.64,"end":9.9},{"text":"seen","start":9.9,"end":10.08},{"text":"a","start":10.08,"end":10.26},{"text":"decline","start":10.26,"end":10.92,"punct":","},{"text":"about","start":11.5,"end":11.64},{"text":"50%","start":11.64,"end":12.48},{"text